  "story": [
    "Nic Donnelly worked in LINZ’s National Geodetic Office and appears in public education, geodetic and earthquake-response records on New Zealand’s reference frame. LINZ’s schools material identifies him as a geodetic surveyor, and later technical records document work measuring and analysing land movement after the Canterbury and Kaikōura earthquakes.",
    "LINZ names Nic Donnelly in its geospatial virtual field-trip record: Geodetic Surveyor, LINZ, 2012 VFT."
